A snapshot of everything left in the tree after the per-task commits above: courtyard, the canvas model, the pill, settings, peek controls, the extension surfaces, icon scope, pinch gestures, and the shared BUILD.gn and window edits those touch. Committed as one unit because the work spans several unfinished features and splitting it would misattribute it.

Signed-off-by: János Mikó <693558+janosmiko@users.noreply.github.com>
